  (description "The ADS BibCode is expressed as a series of six character strings, consisting of the year of publication %28YYYY%29, the identifier for the journal %28JJJJJ%29, its volume number %28VVVV%29, the type of journal %28M%29, the page number %28PPPP%29, and the last initial of the author %28A%29. The format and its use are specified by the Astrophysics Data System %28see http:%2F%2Fadsabs.harvard.edu%29."))
 
