  (endDate "2019-12-31")
  (description "A set of experiments and%2For observations with a clearly defined purpose that is under the direction of a single individual. For example, a series of related laboratory experiments%2Fobservations conducted by a small university team and funded through a single proposal could be an Individual Investigation. Library research by one person on previously published results to distill common conclusions could also be an Individual Investigation."))
 
([pv.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Investigation.pds.type.-1560864404] of PermissibleValue
