  (description "A set of experiments and%2For observations with a clearly defined purpose that uses %28primarily%29 existing facilities, but not exclusively. After %28and possibly during%29 the campaign other investigations are carried out using the same facilities. For example, the International Halley Watch mobilized observatories around the world for collection of data during the most recent apparition of Comet Halley. The Shoemaker-Levy-9 %28SL9%29 campaign used both Earth-based and spacecraft instruments to monitor the SL9 impact on Jupiter."))
 
