([DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Data_Set_PDS3.pds.confidence_level_note] of Definition
  (definitionText "The confidence_level_note attribute is a text field which characterizes the reliability of data within a data set or the reliability of a particular programming algorithm or software component. Essentially, this note discusses the level of confidence in the accuracy of the data or in the ability of the software to produce accurate results.")
  (isPreferred "TRUE"))
