  (definitionText "The data_set_name attribute provides the full name given to a data set or a data product. The data_set_name typically identifies the instrument that acquired the data of that instrument Example value data_set_id. Note This attribute is defined in the AMMOS Magellan catalog as an alias for file_name to provide backward compatibility")
